# env.optional — the briefs still generate without any of these (serp + agent cover core).
# Paid SERP for the per-keyword search-landscape step. Set -> richer/cleaner SERP results;
# absent -> keyless robomotion-serp Search + Auto-Complete (the default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Reddit + review-site scraping at scale (hostile-site fallback, agent-orchestrated):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Not used by any script (the host agent is the model); listed because per-keyword brief
# synthesis is performed by the agent:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
# A paid SEO-metrics API (Semrush/Ahrefs/DataForSEO) has NO Robomotion package — out-of-band
# optional enrichment for volume/difficulty only; no env var consumed by this skill.
